{"annotations":[],"blockId":"bixiu-shang","blockTitle":"必修上","body":"归园田居（其一）\n\n陶渊明\n\n少无适俗[1]韵[2]，性本爱丘山[3]。\n\n误落尘网[4]中，一去三十年[5]。\n\n羁鸟[6]恋旧林，池鱼思故渊。\n\n开荒南野[7]际，守拙[8]归园田。\n\n方宅十余亩[9]，草屋八九间。\n\n榆柳荫后檐，桃李罗堂前。\n\n暧暧[10]远人村，依依[11]墟里[12]烟。\n\n狗吠深巷中，鸡鸣桑树颠[13]。\n\n户庭[14]无尘杂[15]，虚室[16]有余闲[17]。\n\n久在樊笼[18]里，复得返自然。","contentVersion":"yw-3e77f0f7ffa5d042a6d06763","createdAt":"2024-08-21T11:42:06Z","derivedAuthor":"陶渊明","derivedFrom":"lesson-1704","excerpt":"归园田居（其一）\n陶渊明\n少无适俗 [16] 韵 [17] ，性本爱丘山 [18] 。\n误落尘网 [19] 中，一去三十年 [20] 。\n羁鸟 [21] 恋旧林，池鱼思故渊。\n开荒南野 [22] 际，守拙 [23] 归园田。\n方宅十余亩 [24] ，草屋八九间。\n榆柳荫后檐，桃李罗堂前。\n暧暧 [25] 远人村，依依 [26] 墟里 [27] 烟。\n狗吠深巷中，鸡鸣桑树颠 [28] 。\n户庭 [29] 无尘杂 [30] ，虚室 [31] 有余闲 [32] 。\n久在樊笼 [33] 里，复得返自然。","forumImages":[],"forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1704","id":"lesson-1704-p2","learningTasks":[],"postCount":1,"posts":[{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-21T11:42:06Z","id":"11136-2","images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-1","text":"[1]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-2","text":"[2]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-3","text":"[3]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-4","text":"[4]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-5","text":"[5]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-6","text":"[6]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-7","text":"[7]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-8","text":"[8]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-9","text":"[9]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-10","text":"[10]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-11","text":"[11]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-12","text":"[12]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-13","text":"[13]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-14","text":"[14]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-1